{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2-8 player card game inspired by Old Maid. Trick your opponents into pulling cards that harm themselves and away from the cards that will help them. Either by talking with your opponent or, like with more off-putting, like in real life, you can make a card from your hand slightly rotated, or a card out of position. To nudge a player to pick the wrong card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300300/extras/StorePage-Obvious.gif?t=1749165933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300300/extras/Holder.png?t=1749165933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Holder, your goal is to make the current Puller pick the wrong card from your hand. Employ simple tricks like rotating your card or positioning the card to either be higher or lower than the rest of your cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300300/extras/Puller.png?t=1749165933\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chosen for a turn from any of the Holders still alive.\u00a0You are in danger and must not get tricked by any of the holders into pulling cards that would damage you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300300/extras/Features.png?t=1749165933\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable Game: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change how many of each card in a deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How much health each player has.</p></li><li><p 